{"title":"Singles Pickleball Social","startsAt":"2026-10-25T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-25T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Skip the awkward first dates and come for a fun, social afternoon of pickleball & drinks with other singles 💓\n\n**Important:**\n**RSVP’ing on Meetup does not reserve your spot.**\n**To join this experience, you must sign up through [app.cinders.dating](https://app.cinders.dating/eventDetails?eventRef=j2ZrcGCWANVplf6nfDs9). Only confirmed guests will receive the exact location and details.**\n\nEvery month, we curate singles with similar hobbies, interests and profiles and invite them to join a group experience built around an activity.\n\n🥒🎾 **This month, we are doing pickleball**!\n\n**Details**\n🎾 Rotate through casual pickleball games, meet different people, hang out and have a drink between matches. Beginners welcome.\n\n🏆 A little friendly competition at the end, with a Cinders perk for the winners.\n\n📍 King East (exact meeting location will be shown to confirmed guests)\n📅 Sunday, Oct. 25 at 2pm\n👫 16 people (balanced gender)\n🎟️ Ticketed experience. Includes access to a pickleball court.\n\n**How to sign up**\n**[Sign up through cinders.dating](https://app.cinders.dating/eventDetails?eventRef=j2ZrcGCWANVplf6nfDs9). Only confirmed guests will receive the location details.**","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"Cinders: Fun Activities with Curated Singles","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/0/a/6/highres_536284262.jpeg"}